# What stays out of the published archive.
#
# The migration test's fixture: a project written against 0.8 and its
# migrated copy, which import packages this one does not depend on. pub's
# dependency check reads every Dart file that would be published, whatever
# `analysis_options.yaml` excludes, so it is left out of the archive
# instead. The test that copies it out runs in this repository.
test/fixtures/migrate_0_8/
# The same for each migration kind's before-and-after pair, which import
# `flutter3d_kinds`, a package that exists only inside those fixtures.
test/fixtures/migrate_kinds/
build/
.dart_tool/
